msgid "Speech Synthesizer Frontend"
msgstr "Sučelje za govorni sintesajzer"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.kmouth.appdata.xml:9
msgid "KMouth is a program which enables persons that cannot speak to let their computer speak, e.g. mute people or people who have lost their voice. It has a text input field and speaks the sentences that you enter. It also has support for user defined phrasebooks."
msgstr "KMouth je  program koji enables persons taj ne može izgovori za let their computer izgovori, e.g. mute people ili people who have lost their glas. Ga has  tekst unos polje i izgovara  rečenice taj vi unesite. Ga također has support za user defined zbirke."
